Every case exits 1 on both arms because the Harness unit is stopped during these runs. Then alpha.108 was installed on the same database, with the example copied to `config/` at `0600`. `start` and `verify --tenant e2e --turn` pass, and the `--check --online` inside `verify` lists `PASS config` for both files.

The second sweep has 42 single-point mutants over the new code, run as uid 1000 so the non-root tests count:
