| `server.env` adds `optional:file:${QMA_CONF}/` and `QMA_CONF=…/r3conf`; systemd leaves the placeholder to Spring | no row for `r3conf/application.yml` | `PASS config /srv/qma-e2e/r3conf/application.yml` |
