## Markdown → ODT

```javascript
import { markdownToOdt } from "odf-kit";

const bytes = await markdownToOdt(`
# Report Title

Revenue **exceeded** expectations.

## Action Items
- Send report by Friday
- Review budget

| Region | Revenue |
|--------|---------|
| North  | $2.1M   |
`, { pageFormat: "A4" });
```

Full CommonMark support. Accepts the same options as `htmlToOdt`.

